    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/a798fb971bacc7419c8a9ed7adfa411c.avif?t=1750324196\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>\u201cA true friend leaves paw prints on your heart.\u201d</i></h2> And we have 30 friends just waiting for you to pet them! Our good boys and girls come in all shapes and sizes. <br><br><br>However, they are way too energetic for us to handle alone so we need <strong>YOUR</strong> help to organize all these doggos! <br>Just pick them up and place them on the grid over there.<br>And don\u2019t worry if you rotate them a bit, they may bark, but they never bite.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/78d697e2d0ebe025d21a046c16adbe67.poster.avif?t=1750324196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/78d697e2d0ebe025d21a046c16adbe67.webm?t=1750324196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/78d697e2d0ebe025d21a046c16adbe67.mp4?t=1750324196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Dogs</strong><br>30 brand-new &amp; unique hand-drawn dogs for you to befriend, collect and organize (neatly).<br></li><li> <strong>Handcrafted Levels</strong><br>80 brand-new handcrafted levels, which will tickle your brain.<br></li><li> <strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>Play by just clicking the left and right mouse buttons: an accessible experience for newcomers or seasoned puzzlers of any age.<br></li><li> <strong>Relaxing Music</strong><br>Dogs Organized Neatly has relaxing background music! Pretend you are dog sitting your favourite puppers or spending a relaxed afternoon with your best furry friend.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/c16eba1a747377a1fd19bea0b9ed438c.avif?t=1750324196\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/a798fb971bacc7419c8a9ed7adfa411c.avif?t=1750324196\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>\u201cA true friend leaves paw prints on your heart.\u201d</i></h2> And we have 30 friends just waiting for you to pet them! Our good boys and girls come in all shapes and sizes. <br><br><br>However, they are way too energetic for us to handle alone so we need <strong>YOUR</strong> help to organize all these doggos! <br>Just pick them up and place them on the grid over there.<br>And don\u2019t worry if you rotate them a bit, they may bark, but they never bite.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/78d697e2d0ebe025d21a046c16adbe67.poster.avif?t=1750324196\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/78d697e2d0ebe025d21a046c16adbe67.webm?t=1750324196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/78d697e2d0ebe025d21a046c16adbe67.mp4?t=1750324196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Dogs</strong><br>30 brand-new &amp; unique hand-drawn dogs for you to befriend, collect and organize (neatly).<br></li><li> <strong>Handcrafted Levels</strong><br>80 brand-new handcrafted levels, which will tickle your brain.<br></li><li> <strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>Play by just clicking the left and right mouse buttons: an accessible experience for newcomers or seasoned puzzlers of any age.<br></li><li> <strong>Relaxing Music</strong><br>Dogs Organized Neatly has relaxing background music! Pretend you are dog sitting your favourite puppers or spending a relaxed afternoon with your best furry friend.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1597730/extras/c16eba1a747377a1fd19bea0b9ed438c.avif?t=1750324196\" /></div>",
